# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only the chosen files.
# Competition data (train/test parquet, sample_submission) is organiser data
# and is never committed. Submission CSVs (~12 MB each) are also excluded.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!algo*/*.ipynb
!algo1/code_try_quant.py
!algo*/output*/feature_importance.csv

# never descend into these
.venv/
**/.venv/
**/kaggle/
**/__pycache__/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

!/LICENSE
